🌐 DNS - The Internet's Phonebook

# What is DNS?
Definition: The "phone book" of the internet
Function: Converts human-friendly names (like google.com) to IP addresses (like 142.250.190.78)
Importance: Without DNS, you'd have to memorize IP addresses for every website


# How DNS Works in My Capture
The Players:
1. Client = My PC (IP: 192.168.40.X) - Asks the questions
2. DNS Server = My Router (IP: 192.168.40.1) - Provides the answers


